Title           VMware Absolute Pointer
Version         OPENSTEP for Mach 4.2, VMTablet Driver 0.2 (prototype)
Description     Absolute pointer driver tested with QEMU's VMware mouse interface. Install at /, then configure VMware Absolute Pointer and deselect PS2Mouse. Save and cold-boot. Requires vmport=on; GTK is recommended for host pointer release. Supports one display and left/right buttons. Wheel and middle button are not implemented. See README.txt for setup and rollback.
DefaultLocation /
DiskName        VMTablet
Relocatable     NO
Application     NO
LibrarySubdirectory Standard
InstallOnly     YES
DisableStop     YES
LongFilenames   NO
NeedsAuthorization YES
